5. DATA PRIVACY & EPHEMERAL STORAGE RESPONSIBILITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CPShareTXT provides ephemeral data storage and automated purge routines 
(including 5-minute transient destruction of unpreserved records and 25MB file 
upload ceilings). Users and deploying organizations acknowledge that:
  (a) The Software is not intended for the permanent archival of mission-critical 
      records.
  (b) Neither the copyright holders nor the maintainers shall be liable for data 
      loss resulting from automated purge mechanisms, user deletion, or expired 
      transient sessions.


